{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13612","headline":"送客之江西 · 郑锡","name":"送客之江西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乘轺奉紫泥，泽国渺天涯。\n九派春潮满，孤帆暮雨低。\n草深莺断续，花落水东西。\n更有高唐处，知君路不迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「送客之江西」条，撰者储仲君、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"储仲君"}